<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>About Us - LuxePaws Premium Pet Essentials</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/font-awesome/6.4.0/css/all.min.css">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cormorant+Garamond:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Montserrat:wght@100;200;300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-warm: #b87a3f;
            --secondary-warm: #c8a477;
            --terracotta: #b56422;
            --sand: #d8bca4;
            --neutral-rich: #5c544c;
            --spacing-xl: 6rem;
            --spacing-lg: 4rem;
            --spacing-md: 2rem;
            --spacing-sm: 1rem;
            --border-radius: 12px;
            --transition: all 0.3s ease;
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif;
            background-color: #fefaf5;
            color: var(--neutral-rich);
            overflow-x: hidden;
            line-height: 1.6;
            padding-top: 100px;
        }

        h1, h2, h3, h4 {
            font-family: 'Cormorant Garamond', serif;
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: 0.5px;
        }

        .container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 1400px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 2rem;
        }

        /* Page Header */
        .page-header.editable-section[data-section="149"] {
            text-align: center;
            padding: var(--spacing-lg) 0 var(--spacing-md);
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
        }

        h1.about-title.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="150"] {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            color: var(--neutral-rich);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            position: relative;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        h1.about-title.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="150"]::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -10px;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            width: 140px;
            height: 2px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary-warm), var(--terracotta));
        }

        .about-subtitle.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="151"] {
            color: var(--neutral-rich);
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto 2rem;
            opacity: 0.8;
        }

        /* Hero Section */
        .hero-about.editable-section[data-section="152"] {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: var(--spacing-lg);
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
            align-items: center;
        }

        .hero-image {
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 15px 40px rgba(92, 84, 76, 0.1);
            height: 500px;
            width: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .hero-content.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="153"] {
            padding: var(--spacing-md);
        }

        .hero-content h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="154"] {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            color: var(--neutral-rich);
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
        }

        .hero-content p.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="155"] {
            color: var(--neutral-rich);
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        .highlight-text.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="156"] {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-style: italic;
            color: var(--primary-warm);
            border-left: 3px solid var(--primary-warm);
            padding-left: var(--spacing-sm);
            margin: var(--spacing-md) 0;
        }

        /* Mission & Values */
        .mission-values.editable-section[data-section="157"] {
            background: white;
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            padding: var(--spacing-lg);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(92, 84, 76, 0.05);
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
        }

        .mission-values h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="158"] {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
            color: var(--neutral-rich);
        }

        .values-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: var(--spacing-lg);
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
        }

        .value-item.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="159"] {
            text-align: center;
            padding: var(--spacing-md);
        }

        .value-icon {
            font-size: 3rem;
            color: var(--primary-warm);
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
        }

        .value-title.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="160"] {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            color: var(--neutral-rich);
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
        }

        .value-description.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="161"] {
            color: var(--neutral-rich);
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
            opacity: 0.8;
        }

        .mission-statement.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="162"] {
            text-align: center;
            padding: var(--spacing-lg);
            background: rgba(184, 122, 63, 0.05);
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            margin-top: var(--spacing-lg);
        }

        .mission-statement h3.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="163"] {
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: var(--neutral-rich);
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
        }

        .mission-statement p.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="164"] {
            color: var(--neutral-rich);
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        /* Craftsmanship Section */
        .craftsmanship.editable-section[data-section="165"] {
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
        }

        .craftsmanship h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="166"] {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
            color: var(--neutral-rich);
        }

        .craftsmanship-content {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: var(--spacing-lg);
            align-items: center;
        }

        .craftsmanship-image {
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(92, 84, 76, 0.1);
            height: 400px;
            width: 100%;
            object-fit: cover;
        }

        .craftsmanship-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="167"] {
            padding: var(--spacing-md);
        }

        .craftsmanship-text h3.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="168"] {
            font-size: 2rem;
            color: var(--neutral-rich);
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
        }

        .craftsmanship-text p.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="169"] {
            color: var(--neutral-rich);
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        .craftsmanship-stats {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            gap: var(--spacing-sm);
            margin-top: var(--spacing-md);
        }

        .stat-item.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="170"] {
            text-align: center;
            padding: var(--spacing-sm);
            background: rgba(184, 122, 63, 0.05);
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
        }

        .stat-number.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="171"] {
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            color: var(--primary-warm);
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
        }

        .stat-label.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="172"] {
            color: var(--neutral-rich);
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }

        /* Our Story Timeline */
        .story-timeline.editable-section[data-section="173"] {
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
        }

        .story-timeline h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="174"] {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
            color: var(--neutral-rich);
        }

        .timeline {
            position: relative;
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .timeline::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translateX(-50%);
            width: 2px;
            height: 100%;
            background: var(--primary-warm);
        }

        .timeline-item.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="175"] {
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
            position: relative;
            width: 45%;
        }

        .timeline-item:nth-child(odd) {
            margin-left: 0;
            margin-right: auto;
        }

        .timeline-item:nth-child(even) {
            margin-left: auto;
            margin-right: 0;
        }

        .timeline-content {
            background: white;
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            padding: var(--spacing-md);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(92, 84, 76, 0.05);
            position: relative;
        }

        .timeline-year.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="176"] {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: var(--primary-warm);
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .timeline-title.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="177"] {
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            color: var(--neutral-rich);
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
        }

        .timeline-description.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="178"] {
            color: var(--neutral-rich);
            font-size: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            opacity: 0.8;
        }

        .timeline-item::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            width: 16px;
            height: 16px;
            background: var(--terracotta);
            border-radius: 50%;
            top: 20px;
        }

        .timeline-item:nth-child(odd)::before {
            right: -38px;
        }

        .timeline-item:nth-child(even)::before {
            left: -38px;
        }

        /* Team Section */
        .team-section.editable-section[data-section="179"] {
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
        }

        .team-section h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="180"] {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
            color: var(--neutral-rich);
        }

        .team-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: var(--spacing-lg);
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
        }

        .team-member.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="181"] {
            text-align: center;
            background: white;
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            padding: var(--spacing-md);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 20px rgba(92, 84, 76, 0.05);
            transition: var(--transition);
        }

        .team-member.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="181"]:hover {
            transform: translateY(-10px);
            box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(92, 84, 76, 0.1);
        }

        .team-member-image {
            width: 150px;
            height: 150px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            margin: 0 auto var(--spacing-sm);
            object-fit: cover;
            border: 3px solid var(--sand);
            box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(92, 84, 76, 0.1);
            display: block;
        }

        .team-member-name.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="182"] {
            font-size: 1.5rem;
            color: var(--neutral-rich);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }

        .team-member-role.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="183"] {
            color: var(--primary-warm);
            font-size: 1rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-sm);
        }

        .team-member-bio.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="184"] {
            color: var(--neutral-rich);
            font-size: 0.95rem;
            line-height: 1.6;
            opacity: 0.8;
        }

        /* Commitment Section */
        .commitment.editable-section[data-section="185"] {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--neutral-rich), var(--primary-warm));
            color: white;
            border-radius: var(--border-radius);
            padding: var(--spacing-xl);
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-xl);
        }

        .commitment h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="186"] {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing-md);
            color: white;
        }

        .commitment p.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="187"] {
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto var(--spacing-lg);
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        .commitment-stats {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
            gap: var(--spacing-md);
            margin-top: var(--spacing-lg);
        }

        .commitment-stat.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="188"] {
            text-align: center;
        }

        .commitment-number.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="189"] {
            font-size: 2.5rem;
            font-weight: 600;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            color: var(--sand);
        }

        .commitment-label.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="190"] {
            font-size: 1rem;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            opacity: 0.9;
        }

        /* Responsive Styles */
        @media (max-width: 1200px) {
            .team-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
            }
            .values-grid,
            .craftsmanship-stats,
            .commitment-stats {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
            h1.about-title.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="150"] {
                font-size: 3.2rem;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 992px) {
            .hero-about.editable-section[data-section="152"],
            .craftsmanship-content {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            .hero-image,
            .craftsmanship-image {
                height: 400px;
                order: -1;
            }
            .team-grid {
                grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
            }
            h1.about-title.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="150"] {
                font-size: 2.8rem;
            }
            .timeline::before {
                left: 30px;
            }
            .timeline-item.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="175"] {
                width: calc(100% - 60px);
                margin-left: 60px !important;
                margin-right: 0 !important;
            }
            .timeline-item:nth-child(odd)::before,
            .timeline-item:nth-child(even)::before {
                left: -38px;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            main{
                padding-top: 80px;
            }
            .hero-about.editable-section[data-section="152"] {
                gap: var(--spacing-md);
                margin-bottom: var(--spacing-lg);
            }
            h1.about-title.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="150"] {
                font-size: 2.5rem;
            }
            .about-subtitle.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="151"] {
                font-size: 1.1rem;
            }
            .container {
                padding: 0 1.5rem;
            }
            .mission-values.editable-section[data-section="157"],
            .commitment.editable-section[data-section="185"] {
                padding: var(--spacing-md);
            }
            .hero-content h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="154"],
            .mission-values h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="158"],
            .craftsmanship h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="166"],
            .story-timeline h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="174"],
            .team-section h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="180"],
            .commitment h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="186"] {
                font-size: 2rem;
            }
            .team-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
                max-width: 400px;
                margin: 0 auto;
            }
            .values-grid,
            .craftsmanship-stats,
            .commitment-stats {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }

        @media (max-width: 576px) {
            h1.about-title.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="150"] {
                font-size: 2.2rem;
            }
            .about-subtitle.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="151"] {
                font-size: 1rem;
            }
            .hero-image,
            .craftsmanship-image {
                height: 300px;
            }
            .value-item.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="159"],
            .team-member.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="181"] {
                padding: var(--spacing-sm);
            }
            .team-member-image {
                width: 120px;
                height: 120px;
            }
            .commitment.editable-section[data-section="185"] {
                padding: var(--spacing-lg) var(--spacing-sm);
            }
            .commitment h2.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="186"] {
                font-size: 1.8rem;
            }
            .commitment p.editable-text.editable-section.no-drop-zone[data-section="187"] {
                font-size: 1rem;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <!-- Page Header -->
    <div class="page-header editable-section" data-section="149">
        <div class="container">
            <h1 class="about-title editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="150" data-text="92">Our Story</h1>
            <p class="about-subtitle editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="151" data-text="93">For over a decade, we have crafted premium pet essentials that combine luxury, comfort, and timeless design for discerning pet owners.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <div class="container">
        <div class="hero-about editable-section" data-section="152">
            <img class="hero-image editable-image" data-image="27" src="https://images.pexels.com/photos/5324918/pexels-photo-5324918.jpeg?auto=compress&cs=tinysrgb&w=1200" alt="Luxury pet care">
            <div class="hero-content editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="153">
                <h2 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="154" data-text="94">Luxury Craftsmanship Since 2012</h2>
                <p class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="155" data-text="95">Founded by pet lovers and design enthusiasts, LuxePaws began with a simple yet profound vision: to create pet essentials that blend exceptional quality with timeless elegance. What started as a small atelier dedicated to crafting the perfect dog bed has grown into a beloved brand trusted by pet parents worldwide.</p>
                <p class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="156" data-text="96">Today, guided by our founding principles of quality, comfort, and design, we continue to innovate and craft products that celebrate the special bond between pets and their people. Every piece is thoughtfully designed, meticulously crafted, and made to last.</p>
                <p class="highlight-text editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="157" data-text="97">"Every pet deserves the finest comfort. Every home deserves timeless elegance." - Our Founder</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Mission & Values -->
        <div class="mission-values editable-section" data-section="158">
            <h2 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="159" data-text="98">Our Philosophy</h2>
            <div class="values-grid">
                <!-- Value 1 -->
                <div class="value-item editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="160">
                    <div class="value-icon">
                        <i class="fas fa-gem editable-icon" data-icon="25" data-default-class="fas fa-gem"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="value-title editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="161" data-text="99">Uncompromising Quality</h3>
                    <p class="value-description editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="162" data-text="100">We source only the finest materials and subject every product to rigorous quality checks. Our commitment to excellence ensures your pet receives the very best.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Value 2 -->
                <div class="value-item editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="163">
                    <div class="value-icon">
                        <i class="fas fa-heart editable-icon" data-icon="26" data-default-class="fas fa-heart"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="value-title editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="164" data-text="101">Pet-Centered Design</h3>
                    <p class="value-description editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="165" data-text="102">Every product is designed with your pet's comfort, health, and happiness as the priority. We consult with veterinarians and animal behaviorists to ensure optimal design.</p>
                </div>

                <!-- Value 3 -->
                <div class="value-item editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="166">
                    <div class="value-icon">
                        <i class="fas fa-leaf editable-icon" data-icon="27" data-default-class="fas fa-leaf"></i>
                    </div>
                    <h3 class="value-title editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="167" data-text="103">Sustainable Practices</h3>
                    <p class="value-description editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="168" data-text="104">We are committed to ethical sourcing and environmentally responsible manufacturing. Our packaging is 100% recyclable, and we use eco-friendly materials whenever possible.</p>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="mission-statement editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="169">
                <h3 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="170" data-text="105">Our Mission</h3>
                <p class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="171" data-text="106">To create premium pet essentials that enhance the lives of pets and their people, combining exceptional craftsmanship with timeless design while maintaining ethical and sustainable practices throughout our process.</p>
            </div>
        </div>

        <!-- Craftsmanship Section -->
        <div class="craftsmanship editable-section" data-section="172">
            <h2 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="173" data-text="107">The Art of Craftsmanship</h2>
            <div class="craftsmanship-content">
                <div class="craftsmanship-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="174">
                    <h3 class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="175" data-text="108">Masterful Precision</h3>
                    <p class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="176" data-text="109">Each LuxePaws product begins with a vision, translated into precise sketches by our design team. From these drawings, our skilled artisans select the finest materials and begin the meticulous process of creation.</p>
                    <p class="editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="177" data-text="110">Our signature construction techniques ensure exceptional durability while maintaining a soft, luxurious feel. Every stitch, every seam is carefully inspected to meet our exacting standards.</p>
