                    <p class="team-member-bio editable-text editable-section no-drop-zone" data-section="214" data-text="136">With a background in luxury design and a deep love for animals, Sarah founded LuxePaws to bridge the gap between pet comfort and home aesthetics. Her vision guides every product we create.</p>
